{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2023-05-18 09:00:00', 'title': 'DUPONT WINS EDIE AWARD FOR SUSTAINABILITY BENEFITS OF CLOSED CIRCUIT REVERSE OSMOSIS TECHNOLOGY', 'text': "RECOGNITION CELEBRATES CCRO FOR INNOVATION IN \xa0WATER, WASTE AND RESOURCE RECOVERY WILMINGTON, DEL. , MAY 18, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUPONT (NYSE:DD) RECENTLY RECEIVED AN EDIE AWARD HONORING THE BENEFITS OF ITS CLOSED CIRCUIT REVERSE OSMOSIS (CCRO) TECHNOLOGY IN SUPPORTING INDUSTRIAL AND COMMERCIAL CUSTOMERS' SUSTAINABILITY GOALS."}